## Vulnerability Description
The async-git command executor is vulnerable to command injection via user-supplied arguments passed through a shell-invoking exec() function, allowing attackers to execute arbitrary system commands. The vulnerability is mitigated by replacing the unsafe shell execution with a direct child_process.spawn() call in helpers/spawn/index.js.

