- Run this PoC in an isolated VM or containerized environment to avoid accidental host system modifications.
- With the patched version of `kill-by-port`, executing this script will safely throw a standard Node.js error (e.g., `TypeError: Cannot convert undefined/null to object` or process-listing failure) rather than spawning arbitrary commands, confirming the vulnerability is resolved.

