     const prop = path[i];
     // ... traversal logic ...
     if (i === path.length - 1) ptr[prop] = ch.value;
   }
   ```
   Because `changeset` does not sanitize property names before using them in bracket notation (`ptr[prop]`), passing `__proto__` as a segment directly accesses and modifies `Object.prototype`.

