   // can be consumed by either the literal `\?` or the character class `[\x21-\x7E]`.
   // With N ambiguous characters, the engine explores ~2^N partition combinations.
   // A length of 18 crosses the 30,000 backtrack threshold almost instantly (2^18 ≈ 262k combinations).
